==============================================================================================================
    delta K/psi_N at omega = 0: 0  (static: K = 3H exactly, as K1)
    G_1 = d(delta K/psi_N)/d omega at 0 = 2*I*(C*alpha_c + 2*C + alpha_c)/(c_2*(C*alpha_c + alpha_c - 2))
  [PASS] K2 in L340's own block the static response has delta K = 0 exactly and a moving source sources delta K only at first order in omega, with the coefficient G_1(C, c_2, alpha_c) extracted symbolically
